  "text": "AFK Pthentraken\n\n​\nRanged AFK Method (~41 kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMandatory AFK Requirements\n\nThe following are required or this method will not work:\n\n⬥ Fast Instance Speed (not Fastest)\n⬥ Necklace of Salamancy \n⬥ Elder Overload Salve \n⬥ Dinosaur Slayer Task \n⬥ Powder of Penance \n⬥ Greater Ricochet \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Xil  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \n⬥ Elite Dracolich Armour \n⬥ Active God Scripture \n⬥ Ful Arrows \n⬥ Persistent Rage \n⬥ Ultimatums 4 \n⬥ Desolation \n⬥ Insulated Boots \n⬥ Holy Scarab Familiar to upkeep prayer \n⬥ Enhanced Excalibur and Vampyrism for sustain  \n⬥ BoLG with Shard of Genesis Essence  \n⬥ Auto-retaliate is on\n\n\n\n\n\n\nCutting corners will result in failure\n\n\n\n​\nRecommended Preset\n⬥ Ranged preset \n​\n\nAction Bar\n​\n\n​\nVideo Example\n‎AFK Ranged Example\n​\n\n      \n    ",
